# Crossroads_11_alt, east to west: from the arrival gate (Crossroads_07, x 119.5) over the four ledges to x 85.75, outside the Elder Baldur's
# shell (his attack box ends at x 81.6). Planned with hk-walkplan, one hop at a time from where the Knight really landed.
at 119.50 12.39
walk 117.01
walk 117.79   # run-up
walk 117.01   # take-off
hold left+cross for 8
hold left for 22
wait until y between 11.24 11.54 timeout 240   # land at x 112.86
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
walk 111.75
walk 112.53   # run-up
walk 111.75   # take-off
hold left+cross for 34
hold left for 27
wait until y between 11.24 11.54 timeout 240   # land at x 103.32
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
walk 104.10   # run-up
walk 103.32   # take-off
hold left+cross for 34
hold left for 24
wait until y between 12.24 12.54 timeout 240   # land at x 95.29
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
walk 96.07   # run-up
walk 95.29   # take-off
hold left+cross for 28
hold left for 31
wait until y between 11.24 11.54 timeout 240   # land at x 87.13
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
walk 85.75
